OL,3,GNEWSAStories to make you smile from
OL,4,Aacross Yorkshire
OL,5,
OL,6,FEvery week in Yorkshire, we cover
OL,7,Fuplifting and feel-good stories across
OL,8,Four region - and we like to shout about
OL,9,Fthem.
OL,11,FThis week, we're featuring a gig-going
OL,12,Fartist drawing in the midst of a mosh
OL,13,Fpit, an exhibition celebrating David
OL,14,FHockney, and a man's mission to give
OL,15,Fback to the NHS.
OL,17,FMost people cannot even hold a drink
OL,18,Fwhen they are among the crowd at the
OL,19,Ffront of a gig - but for Yorkshire
OL,20,Fartist Sam Joesbury, being thrown
OL,21,Faround in the mosh pit is where he
OL,22,Fcreates his best work.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
