OL,3,GNEWSAStories to make you smile from
OL,4,Aacross Yorkshire
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 22-year-old, from York, started
OL,7,Fdrawing at concerts last year, and what
OL,8,Fstarted as a hobby has led to him
OL,9,Fsketching at several gigs a week,
OL,10,Fsharing his work on social media and
OL,11,Fgaining thousands of fans online.
